"""Clawd — pixel pet overlay for exDesktop (PC).

The desktop plugin runtime has no floating-view API, so the pet is rendered
into its own transparent window with Pillow (Win32 layered window on
Windows, a PyQt6 helper process on Linux). All plugin-facing parts use the
documented SDK surface: BasePlugin, ui.settings, drawer menu items, the
outgoing-message hook, file_utils and client_utils.run_on_queue.

Controls:
  click             — poke
  double click      — jump
  hold              — pet it (move the mouse left/right)
  drag              — move it
  fast throw        — it flies
  right click       — small menu
"""

